# Auto-publish kill switch — PRESENT means the queue lane (.github/workflows/auto-publish.yml
# job `self-publish` -> scripts/self-publish.mjs) is ENABLED. Absent or renamed means the lane
# does nothing at all. Delete this file to disable it; no script creates it.
